Third-party components and weights
=================================

Gemma
-----
Model weights are not bundled. The browser downloads the pinned file in
config/model.json, unsloth/gemma-3-1b-it-GGUF, which is distributed under
Google's Gemma terms of use.

The tests carry material taken or derived from that model:
  - tests/fixtures/tokenizer/gemma-3-1b-it-q4_0.gguf: the pinned file's
    tokenizer metadata (vocabulary, scores, token types, special tokens,
    chat template), copied byte for byte, with no weights
    (scripts/make_tokenizer_fixture.py).
  - tests/fixtures/tokenizer/gemma-3-1b-it-q4_0.inc: token identifiers from
    Hugging Face tokenizers on google/gemma-3-1b-it.
  - tests/fixtures/reference/gemma-3-1b-it-q4_0.inc: logits from llama.cpp
    on the pinned file.
  - tests/fixtures/template/gemma-3-1b-it-q4_0.json: hashes of conversations
    rendered with the model's chat template.

Gemma is provided under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use found at
ai.google.dev/gemma/terms. Its use is also subject to the Gemma Prohibited
Use Policy at ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy.

