Dependencies
------------
Not included in this repository: each is fetched by npm, CMake or a script
at its pinned version.

App (app/package.json):
  - react, react-dom 19.3.1, MIT: the page.
  - three 0.186.1 and @react-three/fiber 9.8.2, MIT: the neuron deck.
  - @huggingface/jinja 0.5.10, MIT: renders the chat template in the worker.
  - Build and checks: vite 8.3.4 and @vitejs/plugin-react 6.1.2, MIT;
    typescript 7.0.2, Apache-2.0; prettier 3.9.10, MIT; @types packages,
    MIT.
Native:
  - Dawn, BSD-3-Clause: WebGPU for native builds and tests, a prebuilt
    release fetched by scripts/fetch_dawn.py.
  - doctest 2.4.12, MIT: the native test framework (tests/CMakeLists.txt).
  - Emscripten, in the emscripten/emsdk:6.0.8 container: builds the
    browser module.
